        ['about','hero','title','About KRTaker'],
        ['about','hero','subtitle','We’re builders who got tired of watching landlords drown in spreadsheets, agents and legal ambiguity.'],
        ['about','why','title','Why we exist'],
        ['about','why','body','Dhaka and Chattogram’s urban boom created a generation of property owners — and a mountain of manual responsibility. Tenants, leases, taxes, repairs, registration deadlines, disputes. For local investors the cost is time; for NRBs it’s distance. KRTaker (Key Responsibility Taker) exists to take that responsibility on — with software that understands Bangladesh’s law and payments, and an AI caretaker that never sleeps.'],
        ['about','principles','title','Our principles'],
